/-! # The Tenth source at short scale `1 / 32`

The short numerators of the factory-ready Tenth source (worker goctad, `tenthSrcVecL 64`, scale
`1 / 128`) are all divisible by `4`; `t10V` has them divided by `4` (numerators at most `8`), so the
dense octad transform fits field width `32`.  The flat short list is recorded in twelve literal
groups of `4096` terms (`t10V_flat`), so that transports can be checked group by group. -/

